tion":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"L'objectif de ta semaine ? La récup, la récup et encore la récup !\nAujourd'hui, interdiction d'accélérer : c'est endurance fondamentale stricte. Et même si ça peut te sembler un peu frustrant, c'est pour ton bien ! Tu nous remercieras lorsque tu arriveras au top de ta forme à la fin du plan.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_35+6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Encore un footing accompagné de lignes droites ! J'espère que tu ressens l'effet positif que ces lignes droites ont sur ta mécanique ? Personnellement, je me sens vraiment \"bien dans ma foulée\" après avoir fait des lignes droites ! C'est comme si ça remettait tout en place !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_29","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":29,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":212,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":341,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2100},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1740,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":341}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":341}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":341}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":341}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":341}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":341}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 3 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 4 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 4 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause à la spécifité que les durées et répétitions diminuent de série en série et que l'intensité diminue. Prend 2'  de récupération entre les séries. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"N'hésite pas à ajuster l'intensité des exercices en fonction de ta fatigue du jour. Mieux vaut une séance un peu plus légère qui n'impactera pas le reste de ta préparation, que de forcer, de se blesser ou de mal récupérer avant le prochain fractionné.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":12,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2tvuktddc","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"sWHMMIyy4h2UCt1nRa02ESjPpivqnf018d","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbna