F","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_50","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":326,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":50,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":3000},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":3000,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"S60_600_Cote6'+_4","description":"Séance de seuil 60' **EN COTE** où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 5'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 4' de footing lent pour récupérer et te laisser le temps de redescendre.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"8ème séance de Seuil 60! Ne prends pas cette séance à la légère. Un intervalle à S60, c’est gérable, mais enchaîner les répétitions, c’est une autre histoire. Concentre-toi sur l’efficacité : posture bien droite, respiration contrôlée, gainage solide. C’est là que tu feras la différence, surtout quand la fatigue arrive.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"trail_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":326,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"S60_Cote_5","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract